[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ……あのハートの形をした狼煙は……\nレース終了の合図だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! That heart-shaped signal flare... that's the signal that the race is over!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くぅ……！\u3000\nこの私が先を越されるなんて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh...! To think someone beat me to it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、どこ？\u3000\nイザナちゃん、よく見えるね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, where? You can see that far, Izana?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ、視力には自信あるからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehehe, I've always had great eyes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふ、ふん。私だって見えてるわよ。\n……というか、いつの間にこんな遠くまで！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hmph. I can see it too, obviously. ...More importantly, when did we end up so far out?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "夢中で探してたらこんな奥まで来ちゃってたんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I guess I got so caught up in the search that I just kept going!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "早く戻らなきゃ夜が終わっちゃう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We have to get back before the night's over!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いっそげーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Move it, move it!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ、なんとか戻ってこられた……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... we actually made it back..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、見て！\u3000\nヴァレリアたちが表彰されてるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, look! Valeria and the others are being presented with their award!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ、ハイディ？\n……いつの間に合流してたのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, is that Heidi? ...When did she show up?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お疲れさま～。\nいやー、すごいレースだったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good work out there, everyone! Man, what a race that was!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さん、無事でよかったです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm so relieved you all made it back safely!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、イザナ、ヨハナ。おかえり。\nどこまで行ってたの？\u3000遅かったじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome back, you three. How far did you wander off? You had us waiting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは……そんなことより、\nハイディさん、お久しぶりです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha... never mind that—it's been a while, Heidi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "家の事情っていうのは解決したの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did you get everything sorted out with your family?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ばっちり。\nちょうどいい時機に戻ってこられた、かな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All taken care of. I'd say I came back at just the right time, wouldn't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらの方は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And who's this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆様、お初にお目にかかります。\nシスターのカロリン・ヤスベルと申します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A pleasure to meet you all. My name is Caroline Jasper—I'm a sister by vocation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caroline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハイディと共に旅をしていまして。\nよろしければ、私も皆様にご同行させていただきたく",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've been traveling together with Heidi. If you'd have me, I'd love to join your group as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caroline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろんです！\u3000ぜひよろしくお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course! We'd be happy to have you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、いたいた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, there you are."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "有力者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dignitary"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あなたは……\n物資の補給をお願いしていた……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, you're the one... who we asked about resupplying..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやはや、素晴らしいものを見せてもらった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a magnificent spectacle you've given us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "有力者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dignitary"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな、優勝したお主たちに尋ねよう。\n愛とは――なんだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And so, I must ask you, our champions—what is love?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "有力者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dignitary"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……愛ってのは――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Love is—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "許すことかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Forgiveness, I think."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あとは、忘れないこと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And never forgetting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……それもまた愛！\u3000\n深い言葉、確かにいただいた！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed... and that too is love! Profound words, and I shall carry them with me!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "有力者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dignitary"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お主たちの大きな愛、しかと見せてもらった！\u3000\n我らホルハーツは今や、お主たちと愛の同志！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You have shown us the depth of your love! Holhartz and your party are now bound as kindred spirits of love!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "有力者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dignitary"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "惜しみない愛と共に、旅の協力を約束しよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With that love, we pledge our full support for your journey!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "有力者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dignitary"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったー！\u3000\nこれで次の島にも進めるね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Now we can move on to the next island!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に、ありがとうございます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much, truly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（こうして、ホルハーツでの出来事が終わり……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And so, our time in Holhartz came to a close...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私たちの旅路に、ハイディさんとカロリンさんが\n\u3000合流したのでした）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Heidi and Caroline had joined our journey, and we set off once more.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]